# The corpus markdown parser (lib/chunking.ts) is now CRLF-tolerant, but this
# still forces LF on checkout so the raw files stay byte-identical to what's
# committed regardless of a contributor's core.autocrlf setting -- a
# git-mv-triggered CRLF rewrite on a Windows checkout is what caused every
# corpus doc's frontmatter to silently parse as "Untitled" during this
# project's Phase 0 restructuring (see lib/chunking.ts's parseMarkdownDoc
# comment).
corpus/**/*.md text eol=lf
